 beyond.\nApplying to graduate school is easy, and our staff are readily available to assist\nwith any questions you may have.\nDeferral Request\nProspective Students\nApplication Deadlines and Requirements\nGraduate Programs and Contacts\nAdmissions Guide and FAQ\nInternational Graduate Admissions\nNext Steps for Admitted Students\nContact Us\nGraduate School\n143 JB George\nHattiesburg Campus\nCampus Map\nEmail\ngraduateschoolFREEMississippi\nPhone\n601.266.4369\nStay Connected\nPay Fees\nHattiesburg Campus\n118 College Drive\nHattiesburg, MS 39406-0001\n601.266.1000\nHattiesburg Campus Map\nGulf Park Campus\n730 East Beach Boulevard\nLong Beach, MS 39560\n228.865.4500\nGulf Park Campus Map\nContact Us\nGive to USM\nFacebook\nTwitter\nInstagram\nYouTube\nLinkedIn\nA-Z Index\nAccreditation\nCampus Safety\nEEO Statement\nEmployment\nEthics Line\nLegislative Updates\nNotice of Nondiscrimination\nOnline Directory\nPrivacy and Legal\nProfessional Licensure Disclosures\nReport a Student Concern\nSARA\nSexual Assault/Title IX\nWeb Accessibility Statement\n\u00a9 2026 The University of Southern Mississippi. All rights reserved.\nLast Updated 8/25/26", "links": [["Skip navigation", "https://www.usm.edu/graduate-school/admissions.php#maincontent"], ["The University of Southern Mississippi", "https://www.usm.edu/"], ["Ready for Life", "https://www.usm.edu/proud/index.php"], ["Admissions", "https://www.usm.edu/graduate-school/admissions.php#admissions"], ["Freshman", "https://www.usm.edu/undergraduate-admissions/freshmen.php"], ["Transfer", "https://www.usm.edu/undergraduate-admissions/transfers.php"], ["Graduate", "https://www.usm.edu/graduate-admissions/index.php"], ["International", "https://www.usm.edu/admissions/international-admissions.php"], ["Academics", "https://www.usm.edu/graduate-school/admissions.php#academics"], ["Undergraduate Programs", "https://www.usm.edu/undergraduate-programs/?type=academics-dropdown"], ["Graduate Programs", "https://www.usm.edu/graduate-p